Package: com.changeinfoios.location
Name: ChangeInfoIosLocation
Version: 2.5.30
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Minimal GPS-spoof sidecar dylib for Apple Maps/Weather/Camera/Photos/Spotlight. Hooks ONLY CLLocationManager + CLGeocoder. No heavy %hook surface — safe for system apps that the main tweak's broader hook set would crash.
Maintainer: ChangeInfoIos
Author: ChangeInfoIos
Section: Tweaks
Depends: ellekit | mobilesubstrate, firmware (>= 15.0)
